\
maskEmail()\
\
generateUUID()\
\
formatCurrency()\
```\
\
Utility harus pure function.\
\
---\
\
## constants/\
\
Berisi nilai tetap.\
\
```\
Roles\
\
Permissions\
\
URLs\
\
Timeout\
\
Status\
```\
\
Jangan hardcode string di seluruh project.\
\
---\
\
## config/\
\
Semua konfigurasi.\
\
```\
development\
\
staging\
\
production\
\
